{"parse": {"title": "世界上最小的涟漪-05", "pageid": 147255, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-04\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">世界上最小的涟漪-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-06\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">世界上最小的涟漪</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.85.89.E6.98.8E.E7.9A.84.E8.8B.B1.E9.9B.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"光明的英雄\">光明的英雄</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 光明的英雄</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Harbinger of the Sunrise</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>啊啊啊啊啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙毫不客气地发出充满恐惧的尖叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到有光亮起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她并未坠入一个恐怖、潮湿且阴暗的地下水牢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间安静的卧室，大小画板依次排列，整洁有序，空气中有淡淡的颜料气息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315723.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315723.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>塔拉萨……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙的声音颤抖着，求救一般地小声念出那个名字，希望能得到肯定的回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而室内的灯光毫无保留地映照出房内陈设，以及房间主人的全貌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>你好，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这声音十分奇特，像带着深海的回响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻，站在她面前的是一个衣着整洁朴素的——鱼头人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>啊！你怎么知道我的名字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我在很久之前就认识你——伽琳涅小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，宁芙又紧张地后退了两三步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你、你怎么连我的本名都知道？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>难道……这是你的神秘术？看透一个人所有的秘密？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她吓得几乎要把自己整个蜷起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>你出生的时候，多里斯给我来信，告诉了我这个消息，以及她给你取的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>泉水宁芙在降生之际，都领受着相似的祝福——伽琳涅，那代表着安详与平静的一生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>不过，多里斯说她有预感——你会选择一个和你本名完全不像的代称。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>那个时候你才刚刚出生。多里斯对很多事情的看法都很超前，她就像一位先知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鱼头人对她温和地笑笑，轻巧地说起往事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而宁芙花了足足五分钟才将这几句话完全消化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你和多里斯早就认识了……在我出生之前？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>那你也一定知道多里斯来到火山岛之前的故事吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-315717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-315717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-315717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>塔拉萨……求你了！我想知道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几乎连滚带爬地来到塔拉萨的膝前，紧紧地抓住了她的手，满脸恳切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>多里斯说得没错，你果然是个特别的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>请坐吧，纳西索斯。我会将一切都告诉你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻拍了拍旁边的椅子，示意纳西索斯坐下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我等待能够讲述它的这一天，已经很久了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shuixiamaopao\"><img alt=\"shuixiamaopao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/600px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/900px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/1200px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-655613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-655613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-655613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我来自一个深海鱼族，原始时期的领地战争使我们失去了前往浅海域的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>海上世界关于我们的传闻，只剩下恐怖噬人的篇章。人们天然不会相信生活在黑暗之中的生物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>所以，在我迄今为止一半的生命里，我从未去过浅海域，也从未见过光明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>当然，深海鱼不需要太阳的光明，种族的特性与历史决定了我们的活动领域。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>但凡事总有意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>有一条叫塔拉萨的深海鱼，她的生命并不需要光明，但她仍然向往海面上的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塔拉萨低下头，对于曾经的渴望与矛盾，她已经完全释然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>一条深海鱼怎么会憧憬海面之上的景象呢？那里并没有她生存所必需的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>况且，这样的憧憬可能会要了她的命。深海鱼甚至无法适应浅海域的压力，更别说去看看水面上的景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>但是，一个族群之中，总会有这样的角色。他们决心出走，满足自己那些不讲道理的渴望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙听得入了神，她的眼睛一眨不眨，闪烁着一种奇异的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>同样地，多里斯也是这样的角色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鱼头人轻轻偏过头，与年轻的宁芙对视。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-3_5_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-3_5_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-3_5_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>塔拉萨，海水女神的化身，真是个好名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>你的鱼鳍……你是一个泉水宁芙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那一天，深海鱼人与泉水宁芙在海水之中相遇，她们交换了彼此的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方的眼中闪过惊讶，能准确辨认出泉水宁芙的人并不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>很多人类的沉船里有羊皮书，我喜欢看书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我看过一本细分宁芙种类的书。不过——泉水宁芙不是只能待在淡水之中吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>是的，你说得没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她点点头，身体自如地在不属于她的海洋之中摆动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>塔拉萨，你来到这么上面的水域，应该也感觉很不舒服吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>你也只属于深海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>嗯……但是我很好奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>好奇？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我只能远远地在水底看到模糊的阳光，“阳光之下流金一样的海浪”是什么样子呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我想知道。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shuixiamaopao\"><img alt=\"shuixiamaopao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/600px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/900px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/1200px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>如果有一天，我能看到那些文字所描述的景色，这种不舒服的感觉……我想我可以忍受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>不过……其实我的胆子很小，到现在，我也只是想想而已……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音又变得局促起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>那是很美的景象，和描述它的文字一样……不，比文字更美。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在奔涌的海浪之中转了个身，畅快地游动着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>塔拉萨，你一定得亲眼来看看，才会知道它是什么样的。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>后来呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙激动得几乎要站到椅子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>多里斯她……她将一枚鳞片送给了我，就在我们第一次见面的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-655613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-655613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-655613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>“它会变成一条只属于你的道路。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>“通往任何你想抵达的地方，无论多远。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-655614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-655614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-655614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>“届时，你只需要前进，便可抵达。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>多里斯这样告诉我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>这枚鳞片只能使用三次，使用者必须对内心的道路足够明确，必须知道自己渴望的到底是什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>所以，所以！多里斯正是用它去往了海洋，而你用它来到了海面之上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>天啊……这实在是太太太波澜壮阔了！这完完全全就是只属于英雄的史诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她简直要手舞足蹈了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>是的，孩子，你说得没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我所认识的多里斯，她将自己的全部身心都献给了大海，她与波涛相拥的故事数不胜数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>在海上的她如此耀眼，当我终于来到海面之上生活后，我也在漫长的生命中走过了世界上的大部分地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>因为多里斯说过，“你一定要亲眼来看看”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>最后，我决定在这个城市落脚，将我和多里斯的故事留存下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可多里斯为什么从来不告诉我们这些故事呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>这是多么好的故事呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>说不定大家听完，就会想和多里斯一样……不，他们一定会想成为多里斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>呵呵……纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她宽容地笑了笑，纳西索斯从那笑容中找回一种熟悉的感觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我无法直接告诉你答案，这个答案只有你自己可以去找寻和理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>不过，纳西索斯，我相信你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>因为和多里斯的通信，我才会知晓你。我一直期盼着我们见面的这一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我一直相信强烈的渴望其实是某种命运的指引，冥冥之中，终点的答案早已浮现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>而你真正找到答案的那一天也会到来，就像今天一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>好！等那一天来临的时候，我会立刻告诉你和多里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她太过高兴，身心几乎都在主动回避一个事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个几乎立刻就能把她击垮的现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯……多里斯她已经去世了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>……我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸出一只手，轻轻放在孩子的肩头上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>这是很长很好的一生，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她猛地抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻，眼泪像渺小的海洋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>是、是的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鱼人轻柔地整理着她的头发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>纳西索斯，让我再告诉你一个秘密吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>明天在市中心的剧场演出，我已经做好准备走到台前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>——我要告诉世人，我就是那些作品的作者。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "世界上最小的涟漪-05"}}